  "id": "meta-attention",
  "term": "meta-attention",
  "definition": "Meta-attention is a learning-model mechanism used to give greater weight to the most relevant information when handling multiple tasks. In the source, it is described as helping a medical recommendation system prioritize useful data and knowledge so diagnosis can be modeled more effectively.",
